WEBVTT

1
00:00:09.267 --> 00:00:22.994
Drew sighed. "I have nothing to do," he said.

2
00:00:22.995 --> 00:00:27.010
"I'm so bored!"

3
00:00:27.011 --> 00:00:32.981
He lay on the sofa and stared up at the ceiling.

4
00:00:32.982 --> 00:00:39.413
Dad walked into the living room.

5
00:00:39.414 --> 00:00:43.635
"What are you doing, Drew?" Dad asked.

6
00:00:43.636 --> 00:00:47.448
"I'm bored," said Drew.

7
00:00:47.449 --> 00:00:50.119
"Bored?" said Dad.

8
00:00:50.120 --> 00:00:53.921
"There's nothing to do," said Drew.

9
00:00:53.922 --> 00:00:56.784
He slid off the sofa.

10
00:00:56.785 --> 00:01:00.068
His feet were still on the sofa.

11
00:01:00.069 --> 00:01:04.440
But his head was now under the coffee table.

12
00:01:04.441 --> 00:01:12.982
"Hmm," said Dad. "Come with me."

13
00:01:12.983 --> 00:01:17.879
Drew followed Dad to the kitchen.

14
00:01:17.880 --> 00:01:21.942
"These dishes are dirty," said Dad.

15
00:01:21.943 --> 00:01:31.511
"Since you have nothing to do, you can wash them."

16
00:01:31.512 --> 00:01:39.061
"Ugh," said Drew.

17
00:01:39.062 --> 00:01:45.720
He filled the sink with hot, soapy water.

18
00:01:45.721 --> 00:01:51.037
Then he got to work.

19
00:01:51.038 --> 00:01:57.217
When Drew was done, he went back to the living room.

20
00:01:57.218 --> 00:02:00.253
"Oh, hi, Drew," said Dad.

21
00:02:00.254 --> 00:02:04.494
"I was going to vacuum the living room.

22
00:02:04.495 --> 00:02:12.806
But since you're bored today, you can do it."

23
00:02:12.807 --> 00:02:22.044
Drew vacuumed the living room.

24
00:02:22.045 --> 00:02:29.589
Next he helped Dad weed the garden.

25
00:02:29.590 --> 00:02:43.176
Then he peeled potatoes and set the table.

26
00:02:43.177 --> 00:02:46.308
During dinner Drew was tired.

27
00:02:46.309 --> 00:02:50.445
"That was a busy day," he said.

28
00:02:50.446 --> 00:02:55.386
Dad smiled. "Anytime you're bored, just let me know!"

29
00:02:55.387 --> 00:03:05.521
Drew laughed. "I'll never say I'm bored again!"
